WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.950
All right, I'm leaving.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.270
Today, let's do the park route.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.810
What is it, Sakura?

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.480
You want to run too?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.110
<b>Woof!</b>

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.650
Then let's go.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>Woof woof woof!!</b>

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>Woof woof woof!!</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.240
<b>Leash</b>

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:19.700
<b>Clip</b>

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.090
I know, that was bad.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.030
But you're getting good at calling my bluff.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.570
Good girl.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:01.980
<b>#06
Things in Common</b>

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:09.210
Sakura, you rest here.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.100
OK.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.350
We ran pretty far.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.170
Oh yeah.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.140
A new song went up today,

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.380
from one of my favorite bands.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:23.990
Hmm

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.200
<b>Excitement</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:29.910
<i>I've been wanting to use these wireless 
earbuds my sis gave me for a new song.</i>

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.670
<b>Disconnected</b>

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.670
<b>Reconnect</b>

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.490
<i>I didn't realize...</i>

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.920
<i>I guess you have to charge the 
wireless earbuds themselves, too.</i>

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.850
<b>Novice</b>

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.850
<b>Demotivation</b>

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.840
<i>Oh, man.</i>

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.340
<i>How lame can I be?</i>

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.100
<b>Crash</b>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.590
Are you all right?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.620
I'm... fine.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.940
<i>He's laughing?</i>

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.150
<i>The confidence to laugh despite being 
in such an embarrassing situation...</i>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.530
<i>This guy's... strong!</i>

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:17.790
What is this?

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.190
Is this the lens cover for your camera?

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:27.910
It is. Thank you!

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.490
You need to watch out.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.220
Dude, you're covered in blood!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.310
I wouldn't call this covered in...

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.080
I guess you can't stand blood?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:43.790
<b>Show</b>

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.370
<b>Show</b>

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:44.960
Knock it off!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.370
I don't even know you!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.590
I was just asking.

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:50.330
And showing!

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.220
So you play handball?

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:56.030
Yeah.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.370
You're athletic, then?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.510
We took first place at the 
ball-game competition.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.740
That was basketball, though.

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:03.830
That's impressive.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.310
You look like that's not really your jam.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.250
I played basketball too, 
up until middle school.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.300
Seriously?

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.110
Is it that strange?

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.270
I guess people don't expect it,
 since I'm short.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.480
It's not your height.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.320
After seeing you fall so gloriously,

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.850
I can't really picture it.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:27.380
Hey, can I come take pictures 
at your next match?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:29.620
I've been wanting to try
 sports photography as well.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.960
I guess you could do that.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.780
I have a test coming up, so 
it'll be some time later.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.580
So do you come here often?

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:38.490
My jogs takes me here.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.500
And it doubles as a walk for her.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.050
What's your dog's name?

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:44.400
Sakura.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.360
Aww, cute.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:49.000
What high school are you from?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:49.970
<b>Pain</b>

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.880
I'm in my first year at a vocational school.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.700
You're older than me?

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.430
The sunset is really gorgeous here.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.960
The weather was good today,
 so I came to take a picture.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.450
You like photography?

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.950
Not necessarily photography.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.760
I just want to preserve 
things that are pretty.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.620
Is that so?

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.780
Hey, since your dog's here, can 
I take a picture of her too?

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:21.930
I guess so.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.210
Do you want to be in it?

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:27.650
Here I go.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.680
Your lens cap is still on.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.940
<i>He's laughing again.</i>

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:36.390
<i>This guy really has a powerful soul.</i>

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.400
<i>Despite being a shorty.</i>

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:42.350
<i>I'd like to also get to the point 
where I can just laugh things off.</i>

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.210
That was on purpose.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.190
I said it was on purpose.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:55.010
What does "I closed my eyes 
on purpose" even mean?

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:55.670
This is too funny.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.490
That's true.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.580
That's true?!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.600
Stop laughing! Delete that!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.260
No.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.810
Come on, delete it!

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:06.490
No. I told you, I want 
to preserve good things.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.100
That is the opposite of a good thing!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.690
You're really going to work now?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.400
What about your hands?

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.080
I forgot about that.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.650
I'll be washing dishes, so maybe 
I should go buy some band-aids.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.450
Want to get some from my sister's place?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.770
It's just up the street from here.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.610
Are you sure that's okay?

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.290
When I was a kid I used 
to get hurt all the time,

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.310
so she has a huge collection of 
all different shapes and sizes.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.330
Really? That's impressive.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.320
Now that you mention it, my older 
brother buys a lot of band-aids too.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.170
I guess we're kind of alike.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.070
I guess so.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.910
Hey, you should come to
 my workplace sometime.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.220
It's in this area.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.800
Then it must be close to my sister's place.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.540
Oh yeah, can you give me your number?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.880
I'll send over that photo.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:52.520
Sure.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.720
I took a lot of pictures 
of you too, Sakura-chan.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.670
That was a lot of fun.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:58.680
<b>Shock</b>

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.990
I forgot my camera.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.650
You put it in your bag 
before we left the park!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.180
How come you crack up so easily?

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:11.700
Was it that funny that you thought 
you had forgotten your camera?

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:13.070
<b>Nod nod</b>

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.520
I don't really get your sense of humor.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.570
I don't really want to 
be grinning that much.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:23.490
I just want to pretend I don't care, 
but it's hard to stay composed.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:26.950
It's really cool how you 
can brush things off.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.650
Cool?

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.050
Yeah.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:35.980
<i>He looks happy.</i>

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.420
"Cool," huh?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.550
Oh yeah, what kind of place do you work at?

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.050
It's a quiet cafe.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:47.380
The owner is really nice, so it's 
really comfortable to be there.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:51.390
I haven't been there too long, but even when 
I mess up, she just laughs and forgives me.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.330
Huh. Sounds like she'd get 
along with my sister.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:58.150
I bet your sister is a fun 
character, just like you.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.380
I guess you could say that.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.740
I was able to get a lot 
of good pictures today,

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.620
so you should show them to your sister too.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.340
Sure.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.380
You should come to my 
sister's place next time.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.810
I'll get you a drink or something.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.250
To thank you for the pics.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.970
Thank you!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.290
Yup.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.100
<b>Insufficient funds</b>

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.420
I guess you don't have enough.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.060
They didn't have the drink I wanted.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.570
Don't laugh!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.480
It's here.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.600
Yeah.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.690
This is where I work.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.690
This is my sister's place.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.980
What was that?

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.880
I didn't hear you either.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.860
<i>The first day of work.</i>

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.400
<i>I'm a little nervous.</i>

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.500
<i>But...</i>

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:51.000
Don't be so worried.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.140
<i>Maybe there are people 
like this around you too.</i>

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.930
<i>They're cool, and good looking,</i>

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.110
<i>and yet slightly...</i>

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.220
Oh, you have to pull.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.610
Good morning.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:13.360
<i>Clumsy guys!</i>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.980
<i>I always do that.</i>

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.350
<i>I did that too.</i>

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.910
<i>I just did that.</i>

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.160
Oh.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.320
<i>At first glance, they may look cool, 
but once you get to know them,</i>

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.470
<i>there may be some fun days waiting in store.</i>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Loop</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
